SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ffooppeenn() and ffrreeooppeenn() functions conform to ISO/IEC 9899:1990
     (“ISO C90”), with the exception of the “x” mode option which conforms to
     ISO/IEC 9899:2011 (“ISO C11”).  The ffddooppeenn() function conforms to IEEE
     Std 1003.1-1988 (“POSIX.1”).  The “e” mode option does not conform to any
     standard but is also supported by glibc.  The ffmmeemmooppeenn() function con‐
     forms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).  The “b” mode does not conform
     to any standard but is also supported by glibc.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     An ffooppeenn() function appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

